OL,3,GNEWSACouncil blocked from relaxing
OL,4,Arural housing rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FStormont officials have ordered Mid
OL,7,FUlster District Council to scrap
OL,8,Fproposed planning policies which would
OL,9,Fhave made it easier to build houses in
OL,10,Fthe countryside.
OL,12,FThe Department for Infrastructure (DfI)
OL,13,Fsaid the policies would undermine
OL,14,Fregional planning rules and could lead
OL,15,Fto "excessive development".
OL,17,FIt said one of the proposals risked
OL,18,Fcreating a "very wide interpretation of
OL,19,Fwhat constitutes a farm" for planning
OL,20,Fpurposes.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
