OL,3,GNEWSACouncil blocked from relaxing
OL,4,Arural housing rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery council in Northern Ireland is
OL,7,Fresponsible for drawing up its own
OL,8,FLocal Development Plan (LDP), which is
OL,9,Fthen assessed by the department.
